    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the waning embers of the year 1911, three siblings are summoned to their childhood home for the funeral of their father. Lucius, a charming conman. Regulus, an aspiring surgeon. And Drusilla, a haunted ingenue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their childhood home is a sprawling estate, deep in the English countryside where time seems to stand still. But when a murder is uncovered, each of the three is put to the test. They have only days to identify the killer \u2013 or else become the next victim.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gothic horror murder mystery story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three playable protagonists, each with their own perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching narrative with multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isometric pixel art graphics illuminated by modern dynamic lighting and shadows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An all-original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dysfunctional relationships, haunting secrets, and maudlin emotional turmoil!</p></li></ul>",
